{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"open-source-commercial-balance","title":"Databricks 开源与商业化平衡策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/open-source-commercial-balance","wordCount":1908,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"academic-startup-dna","title":"Databricks 学术创业基因解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/academic-startup-dna","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-democratization-mission","title":"Databricks 数据民主化使命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/data-democratization-mission","wordCount":1824,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-evolution","title":"Databricks 使命与愿景演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/mission-vision-evolution","wordCount":1965,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"ali-ghodsi-leadership-philosophy","title":"Ali Ghodsi 的领导理念与企业文化基因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/ali-ghodsi-leadership-philosophy","wordCount":2789,"readingTime":12},{"seq":6,"slug":"open-source-strategy-practice","title":"开源与商业化的价值观平衡实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/open-source-strategy-practice","wordCount":2563,"readingTime":11},{"seq":7,"slug":"data-democratization-in-practice","title":"数据民主化理念在产品和决策中的体现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/data-democratization-in-practice","wordCount":2661,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文化与价值观-简介\">文化与价值观 简介</h1><p>Databricks 的企业文化深深植根于其学术创业的独特基因。七位联合创始人均来自加州大学伯克利分校 AMPLab 实验室，他们在创立公司之前首先创造了 Apache Spark 这一改变大数据处理格局的开源项目。这种&quot;先贡献社区，再探索商业化&quot;的路径，奠定了 Databricks 文化的底层逻辑。</p>\n<p>本章从三个维度剖析 Databricks 的文化体系。<strong>开源与商业化平衡</strong>探讨公司如何在坚持开源理想的同时构建可持续的商业模式，从 Apache Spark 到 Delta Lake、MLflow，再到 Unity Catalog 的开源战略演进。<strong>学术创业基因</strong>分析伯克利研究团队如何将学术界的研究方法、同行评审精神和知识开放态度转化为企业运营中的核心竞争力。<strong>数据民主化使命</strong>则聚焦于 Databricks 始终坚持的核心愿景——让每一个组织都能从数据和 AI 中获益——这一使命如何驱动了公司的产品决策和市场扩张。</p>\n<p>Databricks 的六大文化原则——客户至上、追求卓越、追求真相、第一性原理、行动偏好和公司优先——并非空洞的口号，而是从 CEO Ali Ghodsi 的个人经历和学术背景中自然生长出来的管理信条。理解这些文化要素，是理解 Databricks 管理体系的基础。</p>\n"}